 joins Daizaburo and Sleepy later on to help them tackle more difficult cases involving the mafia and drug-running.\n\nMad Bull 34 is inspired by the high-action buddy cop films of the 70's and 80's.\n\n- Thevinnymac, the badass from Ignition-One"},"tags":[{"name":"Nudity","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rape","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Prostitution","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Police","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cars","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Mad Bull 34","english":"Mad Bull 34","native":"マッド★ブル３４","romaji":"Mad★Bull 34","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"マッドブル34"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"捍卫双警34"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"捍衛雙警34"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"34分局"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}